{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "ReserveFlash Incident API",
    "description": "API backend de ReserveFlash Incident (cahier des charges v1.0 + modification corrective R0.1 Local-First, voir docs/adr/0002-local-first-pivot.md). Environnement: development. Le rôle primaire de cette API est app/api/routes/ai.py (proxy IA sans état). app/api/routes/incidents.py est un chemin optionnel/futur (usage cloud), non requis pour l'app mobile V1, et non monté par défaut depuis R0.2 (enable_legacy_cloud_incident_api=False).",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "health"
        ],
        "summary": "Health",
        "operationId": "health_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/config": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "config"
        ],
        "summary": "Get Config",
        "operationId": "get_config_v1_config_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConfigResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/ai/transcribe": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "ai"
        ],
        "summary": "Transcribe Audio",
        "description": "F06/F11 (section 2.1) - transcrit un extrait audio. Ne persiste rien :\nl'app mobile est responsable de conserver le résultat localement (Drift,\nvoir LocalCandidateFactSets).",
        "operationId": "transcribe_audio_v1_ai_transcribe_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TranscribeAudioRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TranscribeAudioResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/v1/ai/extract": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "ai"
        ],
        "summary": "Extract Candidate Facts",
        "description": "F07/F08 (section 2.1) - extrait un `CandidateFactData` structuré à\npartir d'un texte déjà transcrit/OCRisé. Le résultat DOIT ensuite passer\npar la revue utilisateur (F09) puis\n`lib/domain/liability_guard.dart`/`app/domain/liability_guard.py` avant\nde pouvoir devenir un `ConfirmedFactData` - jamais directement utilisable\npar un Reserve Composer (GATE zéro invention, ADR 0001).",
        "operationId": "extract_candidate_facts_v1_ai_extract_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ExtractCandidateFactsRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ExtractCandidateFactsResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "CandidateFactData": {
        "properties": {
          "issue_type_candidate": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/IssueType"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "fields": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CandidateField"
            },
            "type": "object",
            "title": "Fields"
          },
          "requires_review": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "title": "Requires Review"
          },
          "clarification_question_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Clarification Question Id"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "issue_type_candidate",
          "fields",
          "requires_review"
        ],
        "title": "CandidateFactData",
        "description": "Correspond a schemas/candidate_fact_set.v1.schema.json. Sortie brute du\npipeline IA (section 7.2, etapes 1 a 4). Ne DOIT jamais etre utilisee comme\nentree du Reserve Composer."
      },
      "CandidateField": {
        "properties": {
          "value": {
            "anyOf": [
              {},
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Value"
          },
          "source": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/FactSource"
          },
          "confidence": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConfidenceLevel"
          },
          "ambiguous": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "title": "Ambiguous",
            "default": false
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "value",
          "source",
          "confidence"
        ],
        "title": "CandidateField"
      },
      "ConfidenceLevel": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "HIGH",
          "MEDIUM",
          "LOW",
          "AMBIGUOUS"
        ],
        "title": "ConfidenceLevel"
      },
      "ConfigResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "environment": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Environment"
          },
          "reserve_template_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Reserve Template Version"
          },
          "prompt_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Prompt Version"
          },
          "schema_version_confirmed": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Schema Version Confirmed"
          },
          "schema_version_candidate": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Schema Version Candidate"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "environment",
          "reserve_template_version",
          "prompt_version",
          "schema_version_confirmed",
          "schema_version_candidate"
        ],
        "title": "ConfigResponse"
      },
      "ExtractCandidateFactsRequest": {
        "properties": {
          "document_text": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Document Text"
          },
          "transcript": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Transcript"
          },
          "prompt_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Prompt Version"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "prompt_version"
        ],
        "title": "ExtractCandidateFactsRequest",
        "description": "R0.1 (points 4/5/14) - route SANS ÉTAT : `document_text`/`transcript`\nsont déjà des textes (OCR/transcription), jamais des images/audio bruts\nenvoyés \"au cas où\". Voir docs/security.md pour le détail de ce qui est\net n'est jamais transmis au provider IA."
      },
      "ExtractCandidateFactsResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "candidate": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CandidateFactData"
          },
          "provider": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Provider"
          },
          "model_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Model Id"
          },
          "prompt_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Prompt Version"
          },
          "schema_version": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Schema Version"
          },
          "latency_ms": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Latency Ms"
          },
          "request_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Request Id"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "candidate",
          "provider",
          "model_id",
          "prompt_version",
          "schema_version",
          "latency_ms"
        ],
        "title": "ExtractCandidateFactsResponse"
      },
      "FactSource": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "OCR",
          "VOICE_TRANSCRIPT",
          "TEXT_INPUT",
          "LLM_NORMALIZATION"
        ],
        "title": "FactSource",
        "description": "Origine d'un champ candidat (schema CandidateFactSet)."
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Detail"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "HTTPValidationError"
      },
      "HealthResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Status"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "status"
        ],
        "title": "HealthResponse"
      },
      "IssueType": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "PACKAGING_DAMAGE",
          "PRODUCT_DAMAGE",
          "MISSING_QTY",
          "WRONG_QTY",
          "WRONG_PRODUCT",
          "VISIBLE_NONCONFORMITY",
          "OTHER"
        ],
        "title": "IssueType",
        "description": "Types d'anomalie declarables (F05, section 2.1)."
      },
      "TranscribeAudioRequest": {
        "properties": {
          "audio_base64": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Audio Base64"
          },
          "mime_type": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Mime Type"
          }
        },
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "audio_base64",
          "mime_type"
        ],
        "title": "TranscribeAudioRequest",
        "description": "R0.1 (points 4/5/14) - route SANS ÉTAT (app/api/routes/ai.py) : ne\nréférence aucun incident/organisation. `audio_base64` doit contenir\nUNIQUEMENT l'extrait audio strictement nécessaire à l'opération demandée\n(ex: une note vocale ponctuelle), jamais un enregistrement complet non\npertinent - c'est à l'app mobile de garantir cette minimisation avant\nl'appel (voir docs/security.md)."
      },
      "TranscribeAudioResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Text"
          },
          "provider": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Provider"
          },
          "model_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Model Id"
          },
          "latency_ms": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Latency Ms"
          },
          "request_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Request Id"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "text",
          "provider",
          "model_id",
          "latency_ms"
        ],
        "title": "TranscribeAudioResponse"
      },
      "ValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "loc": {
            "items": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              ]
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Location"
          },
          "msg": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Message"
          },
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Error Type"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "loc",
          "msg",
          "type"
        ],
        "title": "ValidationError"
      }
    }
  }
}
